---
import Button from "./ui/buttons/Button.astro";
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="section-y relative z-10 bg-[#0A0A0A] text-[#FFFFFF]"
  aria-label="About Straya Studio"
>
  <div class="main-container">
    <p class="sr-only">
      About Straya Studio explains the studio model, delivery standards, and global
      operating footprint including the founding base in Pakistan.
    </p>

    <!-- Section header -->
    <header class="mb-12 flex flex-col gap-6 md:mb-14 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
      <div class="flex max-w-[42rem] flex-col gap-3">
        <p class="type-label">About Straya</p>
        <h2 class="type-h2">Built by specialists, not scaled by headcount.</h2>
        <p class="type-body text-[#9CA3AF]">
          Straya Studio is a boutique technical studio that takes on only a few
          projects at a time. Founded in Pakistan, we partner with teams across
          Australia, North America, and Europe to ship high-performance platforms.
        </p>
      </div>
      <Button
        href="#method"
        label="See process"
        variant="ghost"
        class="group !w-fit !px-5 !py-3 !text-sm"
      >
        <svg
          class="ml-2 h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-luxury group-hover:translate-x-1 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:group-hover:translate-x-0"
          width="16"
          height="16"
          viewBox="0 0 16 16"
          fill="none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M6 3L11 8L6 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        </svg>
      </Button>
    </header>

    <!-- About content -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-6">
      <article class="md:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-md border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] bg-[#050505] p-6 md:p-8">
        <h3 class="type-h3">How we operate</h3>
        <p class="type-body text-[#9CA3AF]">
          Every engagement is scoped, engineered, and launched by senior specialists.
          We prioritize fast feedback loops, direct communication, and measurable
          outcomes over inflated process.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 pt-2 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-4">
          <div class="rounded-xs border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] bg-[#0A0A0A] p-4">
            <p class="type-caption text-[#6B7280]">Project capacity</p>
            <p class="type-h3 mt-2">2-3 active builds</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xs border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] bg-[#0A0A0A] p-4">
            <p class="type-caption text-[#6B7280]">Delivery model</p>
            <p class="type-h3 mt-2">50/50 milestone split</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="md:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-md border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] bg-[#050505] p-6 md:p-8">
        <h3 class="type-h3">What clients get</h3>
        <ul class="flex list-none flex-col gap-3 p-0">
          <li class="type-body text-[#9CA3AF]">Direct access to the engineers building your platform.</li>
          <li class="type-body text-[#9CA3AF]">Clean, documented handoff on your own infrastructure.</li>
          <li class="type-body text-[#9CA3AF]">Performance-first implementation with scalable architecture.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
